WEBVTT

00:00:03.525 --> 00:00:05.944
-Is he making fun of me?
-No, no.

00:00:06.027 --> 00:00:08.154
Of course he's not, because he's...

00:00:08.238 --> 00:00:10.031
He's your cousin, Johnnystein.

00:00:10.115 --> 00:00:11.616
Yes, yes, yes.

00:00:11.825 --> 00:00:13.076
I don't have no cousin.

00:00:13.159 --> 00:00:16.162
No, no, you do.
He's your sixth cousin, three times removed.

00:00:16.246 --> 00:00:18.290
On your right arm's side.

00:00:18.373 --> 00:00:19.541
You have a cousin?

00:00:19.624 --> 00:00:20.917
Frank, if your arm could talk,

00:00:21.001 --> 00:00:24.045
he would tell you that the original owner
of your arm had a brother.

00:00:24.129 --> 00:00:25.422
Who married a woman.

00:00:25.505 --> 00:00:27.591
-Who was...
-For strangling a pig.

00:00:27.674 --> 00:00:30.135
I have pig-strangling blood in my arm?

00:00:30.218 --> 00:00:31.303
That's kind of cool.

00:00:31.386 --> 00:00:33.263
Well, cuz, great to meet you.

00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:36.975
So, what brings you here, Johnny?

00:00:37.058 --> 00:00:38.435
-What was that?
-Oh, sorry.

00:00:38.518 --> 00:00:40.604
I should really clear my throat before I speak.

00:00:40.687 --> 00:00:42.480
Anyway, what brings you here?

00:00:43.857 --> 00:00:45.317
Party planner.

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:50.614
Yes, I have recruited Mr. Stein here
to help me with Mavis's birthday party.

00:00:50.864 --> 00:00:53.825
Wait a minute, you asked
someone to help you?

00:00:53.908 --> 00:00:55.118
Captain Control Freak?

00:00:55.201 --> 00:01:00.415
It's Count... And yes, I thought having
a Mavis contemporary would be useful.

00:01:00.498 --> 00:01:03.793
Yeah, he totally needed
a fresher perspective.

00:01:04.419 --> 00:01:06.546
Okay, Johnny, Mr. Tight Coffin over here

00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:09.299
was planning to have these
powdered lame-os play at the party.

00:01:11.885 --> 00:01:14.095
So, anyways, we thought
we could liven things up a bit.

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:17.307
Whoa! You all play?
Let's check you guys out!

00:01:20.352 --> 00:01:23.396
Girl

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:27.275
I can't believe it's your big night

00:01:28.902 --> 00:01:35.033
Seems like only yesterday
you were eating mosquitoes

00:01:35.241 --> 00:01:37.911
But now you're eating frogs and mice

00:01:37.952 --> 00:01:42.290
Scarfing them down like Doritos

00:01:42.624 --> 00:01:43.958
Tell me

00:01:44.084 --> 00:01:47.545
Where did the time go, girl?

00:01:47.671 --> 00:01:49.297
Whoa, whoa, whoa. Hold on, guys.

00:01:49.422 --> 00:01:50.632
Stop.

00:01:50.674 --> 00:01:52.300
That's cute, but kind of old school.

00:01:52.425 --> 00:01:54.260
Yes, thank you, Johnny.

00:01:54.302 --> 00:01:56.971
You got to totally tempo things up.

00:01:57.013 --> 00:01:58.515
Here, let me show you.

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:01.518
Werewolf man, give me a jam!

00:02:01.643 --> 00:02:02.644
Two, three, four!

00:02:02.769 --> 00:02:04.938
Vampire girl with the fangy fangs

00:02:05.021 --> 00:02:07.357
Hair real cute with the bangy bangs

00:02:07.482 --> 00:02:09.818
Little princess gonna be a queen

00:02:09.859 --> 00:02:11.986
Legal bat lady turning 118

00:02:14.656 --> 00:02:16.991
-118!
-Say 118!

00:02:17.075 --> 00:02:18.201
118!

00:02:18.284 --> 00:02:20.453
Yeah! Stage dive!

00:02:24.374 --> 00:02:25.500
Awesome.

00:02:25.583 --> 00:02:27.210
I am so blown away right now.

00:02:27.293 --> 00:02:33.883
I think my cuz is gonna
make this the best party ever!

00:02:33.967 --> 00:02:36.302
Yeah! Maybe he can find
a way to get me some chicks.

00:02:36.386 --> 00:02:37.971
We should do a dance contest!

00:02:38.054 --> 00:02:39.764
We're not doing any of that.

00:02:39.848 --> 00:02:41.766
We've got to stay on schedule, all right?

00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:43.435
All right, Dad, all right.

00:02:43.518 --> 00:02:44.978
-Johnny, you're coming, too.
-I don't know.

00:02:45.061 --> 00:02:46.688
-Is it cool with Dracula?
-Johnny, come with us.

00:02:54.404 --> 00:02:56.865
N-27.

00:02:56.948 --> 00:02:59.284
N-27.

00:03:09.836 --> 00:03:11.838
G-61.

00:03:11.963 --> 00:03:13.590
G-61.

00:03:16.342 --> 00:03:18.178
Bingo! Bingo!

00:03:18.219 --> 00:03:19.345
How dare you.

00:03:19.387 --> 00:03:21.347
Do you know what doctor made me?

00:03:21.389 --> 00:03:22.682
I didn't do that.

00:03:23.933 --> 00:03:26.227
Circles?

00:03:26.269 --> 00:03:27.645
Fly?

00:03:29.606 --> 00:03:31.191
-Hands?
-Film.

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:33.860
-Vomit.
-The Vomit?

00:03:33.902 --> 00:03:36.821
-The Throw Up.
-No. That wasn't a clue.

00:03:44.704 --> 00:03:45.747
Nothing?

00:03:45.872 --> 00:03:47.582
-Emptiness?
-Glasses?

00:03:47.624 --> 00:03:50.001
-Glasses?
-Glasses shaking?

00:03:50.418 --> 00:03:51.961
Glasses shaking sideways!

00:03:52.086 --> 00:03:53.922
Through The Looking-Glass?

00:03:53.963 --> 00:03:56.466
I stink at this.

00:04:26.704 --> 00:04:28.623
I didn't do that.

00:04:29.123 --> 00:04:32.961
And pull it back. And up. And push.

00:04:33.002 --> 00:04:35.421
And twist. And back.

00:04:35.463 --> 00:04:37.674
And up. And twist.

00:04:37.799 --> 00:04:39.092
And push.

00:04:42.345 --> 00:04:44.430
No. Don't copy that.

00:04:44.472 --> 00:04:47.475
And back. And up. And twist.

00:04:51.145 --> 00:04:56.067
Let me get a bubonic moose nose omelet
with cockroach paste and mouse jelly.

00:04:56.317 --> 00:04:58.027
And with egg whites.

00:04:59.445 --> 00:05:01.614
Bonjour, Monsieur Dracula!

00:05:01.656 --> 00:05:03.199
May I make you an omelet?

00:05:03.324 --> 00:05:05.034
No, no, no, no. I'm not hungry.

00:05:06.327 --> 00:05:08.997
What? Esmeralda, you smell it again?

00:05:09.122 --> 00:05:10.832
-Human?
-I am hungry.

00:05:11.457 --> 00:05:14.669
Johnny, you've been to the Taj Mahal?

00:05:14.794 --> 00:05:17.213
Come on. No monster's been to the Taj.

00:05:17.338 --> 00:05:19.674
Man, I wish I could go there.

00:05:19.883 --> 00:05:21.843
You know what? I'll take 50 omelets.

00:05:22.844 --> 00:05:24.679
You heard the man! Make them!

00:05:26.890 --> 00:05:28.349
How did you deal with the mobs?

00:05:28.391 --> 00:05:30.685
Yeah, it does get pretty crazy in the summer.

00:05:30.727 --> 00:05:32.520
But, you know, you just got to roll.

00:05:32.562 --> 00:05:35.189
He just rolls. That's cool that he rolls.

00:05:35.231 --> 00:05:36.357
Yes, yes, cool.

00:05:36.566 --> 00:05:40.987
Look, love droppings, I brought you
a bagel with your favorite, scream cheese.

00:05:41.029 --> 00:05:42.530
Holy rabies. Thanks, Dad.

00:05:42.655 --> 00:05:44.365
Johnny, try some scream cheese,
it's awesome.

00:05:44.657 --> 00:05:45.825
Oh, cool.

00:05:45.867 --> 00:05:49.704
But I'm scream cheese intolerant.
So, polite pass.

00:05:49.913 --> 00:05:51.414
Yes, of course you are.

00:05:51.539 --> 00:05:54.876
Johnny, can we party-plan talk for a minute?

00:05:55.001 --> 00:05:56.169
What are you doing?

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:58.338
If they find out you are human,
they'll go bat poop!

00:05:58.379 --> 00:06:00.548
Relax. No one suspects anything.

00:06:00.673 --> 00:06:03.259
The only thing that looks weird
is how much whispering you're doing.

00:06:05.511 --> 00:06:08.848
Just wrap it up. You will say you are
going in the pool and act excited.

00:06:08.890 --> 00:06:12.393
And then you will say you hurt your back
and you have to leave.

00:06:14.854 --> 00:06:16.397
Here come good times!

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:18.942
Oh, dudes. Oh, my back.

00:06:19.067 --> 00:06:20.234
I'm on your back!

00:06:20.401 --> 00:06:22.362
No, no. He said, "Oh, my back."

00:06:22.403 --> 00:06:24.572
-Get on my back!
-Let's do it.

00:06:24.739 --> 00:06:27.909
Here we go. Chicken fight! Push them off!

00:06:27.951 --> 00:06:30.244
Chicken fight!

00:06:31.287 --> 00:06:32.413
We got you, Johnny.

00:06:32.455 --> 00:06:33.873
-You're going down.
-Whoa.

00:06:33.915 --> 00:06:37.085
Oh, yeah, we'll see, "Mavey Wavey."

00:06:40.129 --> 00:06:42.465
Okay, calm down with the fight chickens!

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:44.968
Everyone, stop the roughhousing!

00:06:51.265 --> 00:06:53.768
Frank, if you hurt yourself...

00:06:53.810 --> 00:06:55.311
I got it, honey.

00:06:55.436 --> 00:06:58.147
The Stein boys are bred
for this kind of thing.

00:06:58.272 --> 00:06:59.649
Geronimo!

00:07:11.953 --> 00:07:13.830
Kids, why'd you do that?

00:07:14.414 --> 00:07:15.623
I was just in the pool.

00:07:15.665 --> 00:07:16.791
The water's cold.

00:07:16.833 --> 00:07:18.292
Don't judge me!

00:07:19.585 --> 00:07:21.629
Johnny. Your makeup.

00:07:21.754 --> 00:07:23.464
Your makeup!

00:07:23.589 --> 00:07:24.799
Climb out. Now.

00:07:26.467 --> 00:07:27.635
Oh, man.

00:07:27.677 --> 00:07:30.304
I guess the Count wanted to go for a swim.

00:07:43.484 --> 00:07:45.194
Cannonball!

